  "title": "mdb: simpler approach for filter stings",
  "description": "Use a simpler pattern for MDB filter strings.\n\nAt first, the idea was to use mdb.<peripheral>.<command>.<component>, e.g.\nmdb.cashless.vend.item_number. It turned out that this makes no sense.\nThe same component may appear in several commands. Using\nmdb.<peripheral>.<component> is a better option.\n\nModify two filter strings to be in line with the new approach.",
